      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "hmm, thats not that bad. But I could still see the problem, that people with custom avatar, especially the people with comissions, wich payed money will activate this and therefore (too)many avatars will be \"blocked\" then, wich in my opinion would be pretty bad for the whole experience.",
