      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I know a good percentage of my friends will show their avatars in private, but will not want to visit public worlds at all due to their avatar's blueprints being distributed to clients not on their friends list.\n\nIf they do go to a public world, they will switch to some generic avatar they don't care much about. I suspect this behavior is fairly common especially among people with commissioned avatars, so the experience is already compromised today.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
