      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b53a6b8487a0525c482b1d9|full_name}: This is exactly why I also proposed the \"additional feature\" of setting an avatar the user doesn't care about to be sent instead of the generic floating gray thing.",
      "viewerReactions": null
