  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-06-22T05:30:22.775Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Concerns are viral about users with hacked clients or otherwise the capability to rip complete avatar models from the cache.\n\nAn option which completely disables sending a given player's avatar to strangers should, if done properly, 100% prevent hackers that can't already access the database/servers/S3 storage of VRChat from ripping avatars.\n\nWhen this option is enabled, private avatars will NOT be sent to players not on their immediate friends list, but public ones will. A potential additional feature could allow a player with this option enabled to instead serve a public or default avatar. Otherwise, strangers will see the same model as if they had enabled \"Block avatars by default\".",
